#. module: tattoo_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:tattoo_shop.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>CRM App</b>: Manage your leads effectively, tracking ongoing tattoo "
"projects and consultations to ensure no client request is lost."
msgstr ""
"<b>Aplikacija CRM</b>: Učinkovito upravljajte svoje potencialne stranke, "
"spremljajte tekoče projekte tetoviranja in posvete ter tako zagotovite, da "
"nobena zahteva stranke ne bo izgubljena."

#. module: tattoo_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:tattoo_shop.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Purchase App</b>: Automate the restocking of essential supplies like ink, "
"gloves, and needles to ensure you never run out during a session."
msgstr ""
"<b>Aplikacija Nabava</b>: Avtomatizirajte dopolnjevanje zalog osnovnih "
"potrebščin, kot so črnilo, rokavice in igle, da vam jih med terminom nikoli "
"ne zmanjka."

#. module: tattoo_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:tattoo_shop.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Sign App</b>: Handle critical compliance by managing consent forms and "
"important waivers effortlessly with secure digital signatures."
msgstr ""
"<b>Sign App</b>: Poskrbite za ključno skladnost s predpisi z enostavnim "
"upravljanjem obrazcev soglasja in pomembnih izjav o odpovedi odgovornosti z "
"varnimi digitalnimi podpisi."

#. module: tattoo_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:tattoo_shop.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Social Marketing App</b>: Amplify your reach by sharing your latest "
"creations across social platforms and engaging with your audience "
"centrally.Restock supplies with ease using the <strong>Purchase App</strong>."
msgstr ""
"<b>Aplikacija za družbeno trženje</b>: Povečajte svoj doseg tako, da svoje "
"najnovejše stvaritve delite na družbenih platformah in se centralno "
"povezujete s svojim občinstvom.Preprosto dopolnite zaloge z uporabo <strong>"
"aplikacije za nabavo</strong>."

#. module: tattoo_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:tattoo_shop.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Website App</b>: Build a stunning online portfolio to showcase your work "
"and attract new clients with a professional digital presence."
msgstr ""
"<b>Aplikacija Spletna stran</b>: Ustvarite osupljiv spletni portfelj, s "
"katerim boste predstavili svoje delo in pritegnili nove stranke s "
"profesionalno digitalno prisotnostjo."

#. module: tattoo_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:tattoo_shop.about_us
#, fuzzy
msgid "<br/> Get tattoos that reflect your dedication to self-expression."
msgstr "<br/> Pridobite tetovaže, ki odražajo vašo predanost samoizražanju."

